<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>
      {% if portal_lex_product_name | default('') %}{{ portal_lex_product_name }}{% else %}Mesh{% endif %}
      onboarding link — reachable only off mesh
    </title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        background: #0b1e33;
        color: #f5f7fa;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 640px;
        padding: 24px 28px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background: #12263f;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
      code {
        font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 0.95em;
        background: #0b1e33;
        padding: 2px 4px;
        border-radius: 3px;
      }
      strong {
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .product {
        opacity: 0.85;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="product">
        {% if portal_lex_product_name | default('') %}
          {{ portal_lex_product_name }} onboarding
        {% else %}
          Mesh onboarding
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <h1>Disconnect from the mesh to open this link</h1>
      <p><strong>You're connected over the mesh (VPN).</strong></p>
      <p>
        This invitation link is a <strong>public</strong> enrollment page and
        can't be reached while you're on the mesh.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Disconnect from the mesh/VPN</strong>
        (for example run <code>netbird down</code> on this device, or use a
        device that isn't on the mesh — a phone on cellular works) and then
        reopen your invitation link.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
